7. **Note — the coupled-Gumbel/STOP design is sound, but pin its exact sequence.** [Lines 25–27](/Users/poonszesen/kg-v3/ops/rebuild-2026-09-29/briefs/2.3-action-heads.md:25) agree with the reference provided sampling uses the **exclusive raw-HIRE prefix count**, masks HIRE when capacity is exhausted, and reuses the same perturbed scores without redrawing. Density evaluation must then use the **exclusive final-HIRE prefix count**.

