    28	    ``unit_quantity_low[present, high_is_zero]`` preserves explicit positive
    29	    transfer quantities. Invalid unit kinds have forced-zero placeholder rows;
    30	    callers must still apply ``unit_kind``. Global order count, first NONE and
    31	    HIRE budget are separate program constraints, checked by the native decoder.
