   GPU qualification may remain in Phase 6, but explicitly hand off production compiler/BF16 rollout-versus-minibatch and chunk-boundary checks, plus Task 3.6’s pre-update log-ratio alarm. CPU equality does not close L6.

5. **Should-fix — correct embedding initialization wiring; the stated Muon exclusions and output gain are otherwise right.** Isaiah excludes declared actor role/token parameters through [`get_input_layers`](/Users/poonszesen/kg-v3/python/owl/model/actor/discrete_targets.py:141), rather than applying a blanket embedding-type exclusion. His actor output gain is **0.01**.

